{
  // Renovate (https://docs.renovatebot.com/) already applies to every xwiki-contrib repository, without this file: it
  // inherits the configuration of https://github.com/xwiki-contrib/renovate-config, which extends the preset shared by
  // the xwiki-contrib repositories, https://github.com/xwiki-contrib/.github/blob/master/renovate/default.json5 (itself
  // extending the preset of the xwiki organization). Improvements useful to every contrib repository go in that preset.
  //
  // Only add here what is specific to this repository, applied on top of the inherited configuration, for example:
  // * extra "packageRules" (concatenated with the presets' ones, while any other array replaces the presets' value);
  // * "enabled": false to disable Renovate for this repository;
  // * "ignorePresets": ["github>xwiki-contrib/.github//renovate/default.json5"] to not use the shared preset.
  // See https://docs.renovatebot.com/configuration-options/ for all the options. If nothing is needed, keep this file
  // as is or delete it.
}
